{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24113","headline":"酬牛相公宫城早秋寓言见示兼呈梦得 · 白居易","name":"酬牛相公宫城早秋寓言见示兼呈梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七月中气後，金与火交争。\n一闻白雪唱，暑退清风生。\n碧树未摇落，寒蝉始悲鸣。\n夜凉枕簟滑，秋燥衣巾轻。\n疎受老慵出，刘桢疾未平。\n何人伴公醉，新月上宫城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}